WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.720
Adding bling to your
smile isn't anything new,

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.150
but one of the buzziest
ways to do it these days

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.670
is with tooth gems.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.600
They're small crystals,
diamonds, or charms

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.363
that are literally glued to
the enamel of your teeth.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.753
Tooth gems are akin to grills,

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:22.520
popularized by African
American hip-hop artists

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.410
in the '80s and '90s.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.160
Celebrities including
Drake, Hailey Bieber,

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.070
and Katy Perry seem to love
adding them to their smiles.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.140
We visited Dr. Bobbi Peterson,

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:35.540
who places tooth gems for
celebrities like Justine Skye,

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:39.273
to see how one is placed by
one of her repeat clients.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.586
Jhenelle Hill: I got my first tooth gem

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.361
about six months ago.

00:00:46.361 --> 00:00:48.970
I love how it blings on
this side, but I'm like,

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.620
this side's so empty
that I would love that

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.930
when I switch angles,

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.270
to have a little bling on this side also.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.070
Bobbi Peterson: This procedure does

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.945
not damage your teeth in any way.

00:00:58.945 --> 00:01:00.670
This is why I love to do them.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:01.927
Dr. Bobbi Peterson

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:03.560
always conducts a consultation

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.560
to help a client find their
ideal gem and its placement.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.010
Her gems include crystals,
diamonds, and precious metals.

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.270
Each one ranges from $50 to $500.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:15.910
Subtle gems are usually
placed on the canines,

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:18.750
first premolars, and visible teeth below.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.430
For a more noticeable look,

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:24.021
tooth gems are placed on the
central and lateral incisors.

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.110
Jhenelle: Now that I'm looking at it,

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:30.210
I think I wanna add one to the right.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.220
The placement process

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:34.173
is pretty straightforward
and takes about five minutes.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.050
First, the tooth is completely isolated

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:41.610
using a retractor and cotton rolls.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.665
After it is cleaned and
dried, an etching solution,

00:01:44.665 --> 00:01:48.407
which repairs the tooth's
surface for the glue, is applied.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:51.260
Once the solution is
wiped and rinsed away,

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.800
more air is applied.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.380
The bond to the sealant
is placed onto the tooth

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.190
and dried with a UV light.

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:59.400
The glue is squeezed over the sealant,

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:03.078
and the tooth gem is placed using wax.

00:02:03.078 --> 00:02:05.520
The gem is adjusted to
a precise placement.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.540
Once the client confirms that
they like the gem's position,

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.200
it is cured to the tooth using a UV light,

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.830
which takes about one minute.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:15.380
The gem is polished and good to go.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.790
Peterson: There are no
negative long-term effects

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.880
of you wearing the stone,

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.950
unless you get your teeth
whitened every month

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:35.020
and your teeth around the
gem are five shades whiter.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.100
It's a little bit harder
to bleach the area

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.390
that's underneath the stone.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.830
Jhenelle: I love it.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.810
I thought I wanted it on this side,

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:47.610
but after she, you know, showed
me the placement options,

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.060
I definitely wanted it, you know,

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.950
right next to the one I originally had.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.970
I am so excited to show
it off to everybody.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.070
I really feel pretty.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.519
Like, I feel gorgeous.

